{
  "sequence_id": "seq_eaad741293da2ac1",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You look tired. How 'bout I get some coffee?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "NAW, it's cool. Gonna take a little nap instead."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Guess I'll be on my way then."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Thanks, skip. I really appreciate--"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Klinik"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "WHAT'S UP, ASH?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hm? Nothing..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hey, coffee's on me, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "All right."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "About this trouble with Dino...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "1 D/D hear somethin'. I hear it was actually Arthur who gave 'em the word."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "THAT'S WHAT I FIGURED."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Sooner or later, I'm going to have to settle with him."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You STACKIN' UP ENEMIES IN THE FAMILY, ASH."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You sure about all this?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "See you later, skip."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "PAPA."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "WHAT?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'd appreciate it if you could open the door a bit more gently."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I don't want to disturb my orchids."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "N-NEVER MIND THAT!"
    }
  ],
